## ServersApi

### Place a custom dedicated server order, creating a real billable invoice
## Place a custom dedicated server order, creating a real billable invoice
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/servers/order
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "cpu": "<number>",
 "hd": "<string>",
 "memory": "<number>",
 "bandwidth": "<number>",
 "ips": "<number>",
 "os": "<number>",
 "cp": "<number>",
 "raid": "<number>",
 "region": "<number>",
 "servername": "<string>",
 "rootpass": "<string>",
 "tos": "<string>",
 "comment": "<string>"
}


